==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 275,000 and increases by 25,000 with each stage.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Doge]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Selena]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 8~14.67 seconds<sup>240f~440f</sup>.
**3 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns.

